s like finding your purpose. With a legacy spanning three generations, the Jimny remains a small yet mighty 4WD vehicle, daring to explore.  <br></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-46_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-47_"><a href="https://pentamotorgroup.co.za/pages/suzuki-jimny-deals" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-knuQPt gsrWsr pf-48_ pf-button-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-50_">View Jimny Deals&nbsp;</span><i class="sc-kgOKhb fDsHtk pf-49_ pf-icon-1 pfaV4 pfaV4-arrow-circle-right" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-fe90" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-51_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-52_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-53_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-54_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-56_">Features</span></h2></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-57_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/Suzuki_Jimny_Brochure_1b8cf844-a7e7-474a-a025-cca1cff5432c.pdf?v=1770973473" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-knuQPt gsrWsr pf-58_ pf-button-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-60_">Brochure</span><i class="sc-kgOKhb fDsHtk pf-59_ pf-icon-1 pfaV4 pfaV4-arrow-circle-down" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/SUZUKI_NOVEMBER_2021_PRICE_LIST.pdf?v=1637871791" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Butt